# Architecture Kit ({{projectName}})

This repo uses **@folklore/architecture-kit**. Resolves from `../architecture-kit`, `vendor/architecture-kit`, or optional `node_modules` install.

- Config: `architecture.config.json`
- Docs source: `docs/architecture/`, `docs/adr/`, `docs/diagrams/`
- AI entrypoint: `docs/architecture/ai-context.md`

## Commands

```bash
npx architecture-kit validate
npx architecture-kit doctor
npx architecture-kit build
npx architecture-kit dev
```

Host-app embedding (mount path, link rewriting) is **project-side only** — the kit builds a standalone site.

## Scope hints for agents

- Kit/template/validator changes → **architecture-kit** repo
- Application code → **this project** repo
- Say explicitly when a task is docs-only vs code-only
